  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 2207.03 Signature Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 2207.03 Signature Required. The signature provided by the employee or official of a governmental unit shall constitute certification that:\n\n(a) The information provided on or with the application form, as applicable, is true, complete, and not misleading to the best of the applicant’s knowledge; and\n\n(b) The certification is subject to renewal annually and is contingent upon both successful completion of continuing education requirements and submittal of annual reports.\n\nSource. #13982, eff 5-24-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq2200.html"
}
